    "fortune": {
      "head": {
        "evidence": [
          {
            "basis": {
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "Today is marked Ordinary day, and today's heavenly stem counts as Bigyeon to your Day Master, so we chose today's main reading based on these two."
                }
              ]
            },
            "detail": {
              "day_kind": "ORDINARY_DAY",
              "group": "BIGYEOP",
              "ten_god": "BIGYEON"
            },
            "ruleId": "fortune/day_kind",
            "source": {
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "Yangin, Bigyeon, Paejae and Geonrok have different names but are really one family of the same energy.\n余按陽刃比肩敗財建祿名雖不同實一家同氣之神\nSammyeong Tonghoe, 論建祿"
                }
              ]
            },
            "sourceRef": "sammyeong-tonghoe/personal#ten_god.geonrok"
          },
          {
            "basis": {
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "You were born in summer or winter and your chart runs too hot or too cold, so we set your "
                },
                {
                  "term": "role.yongsin",
                  "text": "Yongsin"
                },
                {
                  "text": " by the Johu method, which evens out temperature. The element that fits your Day Master in the 巳 month follows the Johu table of Gungtong Bogam."
                }
              ]
            },
            "detail": {
              "month_branch": "巳",
              "share": "0.3143",
              "threshold": "0.3000"
            },
            "ruleId": "yongsin/johu",
            "source": {
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "For a Gyeonggeum Day Master born in the fourth month, Byeonghwa does not melt metal, so the flames are no threat and Byeonghwa can be used too, but Imsu must come first to reach balance; hence metal born in summer welcomes earth.\n丙不鎔金，故不畏火炎，丙亦可作用，但先壬水，方得中和，故曰羣金生夏，喜用勾陳。\nGungtong Bogam, 四月庚"
                }
              ]
            },
            "sourceRef": "gungtong-bogam/johu_evidence#庚.巳"
          }
        ],
        "messageKey": "fortune.ordinary_day.bigyeop",
        "reactable": true,
        "slot": "daily.fortune.head",
        "text": {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "Work at your own pace instead of matching others."
            }
          ]
        },
        "todayReason": {
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "This energy comes from how today's heavenly stem relates to your Day Master."
            }
          ]
        },
        "variant": "advice"
      },
